---
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import Page from '../layouts/Page.astro';
import workbench from '../assets/workbench.png';
---
<Page>
  <main class="homepage">
    <div class="hero">
      <h1>Kogen Studio</h1>
      <div class="identity">
        <Image src={workbench} alt="Kogen Studio — a workbench with a monitor and an open box" widths={[384, 640, 960, 1280, 1536]} sizes="(max-width: 728px) calc(100vw - 48px), 680px" format="webp" quality={90} loading="eager" fetchpriority="high" />
        <a href="https://kogen.dev">Kogen ↗</a>
      </div>
    </div>
    <section class="context" aria-labelledby="project-context"><h2 id="project-context">About this project</h2><p>Kogen Studio is the wider product-development system around Kogen’s bounded software feature workflow. Its product direction concerns preserving durable product context and coordinating the lifecycle before and after a feature is shaped, approved and built. Kogen owns Shape → Approve → Build → Commit; Studio does not recreate or overrule that loop.</p><p>This website is an identity and reference surface. No Studio application is implemented, and this page is not a sign-up, software download or hosted Studio interface. The workbench image identifies the project. Follow Kogen for its current public introduction, source and announcements; do not infer Studio availability from the existence of this domain.</p></section>
  </main>
</Page>
<style>
  .homepage{display:block}.hero{min-height:calc(100svh - 48px);display:grid;place-items:center}
  .context{max-width:680px;margin:0 auto 32px;line-height:1.65}.context h2{font-size:24px}.context p{margin-top:16px}
  h1 { position: absolute; width: 1px; height: 1px; padding: 0; margin: -1px; overflow: hidden; clip-path: inset(50%); white-space: nowrap; border: 0; }
  .identity { width: min(100%, 680px); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; gap: 24px; }
  img { display: block; width: 100%; height: auto; max-height: calc(100svh - 140px); object-fit: contain; }
  @media (max-width: 480px) { .identity { gap: 16px; } }
</style>
